<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Login verification code</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px; margin-top: 20px;">
    <h2 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 20px;">Login verification code</h2>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>You are attempting to log in. Your verification code is:</p>
    <div style="background: #fff; border: 2px dashed #3498db; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
      <span style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #3498db;">{{code}}</span>
    </div>
    <p style="color: #e74c3c; font-size: 14px;">This verification code is valid for {{expiresIn}}, please use it as soon as possible.</p>
    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 30px;">If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
